# See PHASE6_DOCKER_PLAN.md Stage 2. Keeps the build context small and,
# more importantly, keeps host-local runtime state (real alert rules, the
# real LAN device ledger, real secrets) out of the image -- data/ is meant
# to arrive via docker-compose.yml's bind mount at run time, not be baked
# in at build time.
node_modules/
data/*.json
data/*.log
.env
.git/
.claude/
*.bak
